	"description": "Create professional videos with ease! This add-on allows you to:\n- Create slideshow videos from photos and videos with audio\n- Add captions to individual photos and videos\n- Create running text/ticker videos from text and audio\n- Apply transitions between photos/videos\n- Remove green/blue backgrounds from photos\n- Use custom backgrounds (black, white, or custom image)\n- Ken Burns zoom effect\n- Watermark your videos\n- Save and load projects\n\nKeyboard Shortcuts:\n- NVDA+Shift+3: Create video from photos/videos and audio\n- NVDA+Shift+4: Create running text video\n\nNote: Requires ffmpeg to be installed in the add-on directory.",
