	"changelog": "Version 1.0.0:\n- Initial release with full video creation features\n- Support for photos and videos as source material\n- Running text/ticker video creation\n- Background removal from photos (green/blue screen)\n- Custom backgrounds (black, white, or custom image)\n- Pause/Resume/Cancel progress dialog\n- Caption support with proper text rendering\n- Ken Burns zoom effect\n- Various transitions between clips\n- Watermark support\n- Save and load projects\n- Configurable quality settings (SD, HD, Full HD)",
